        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ji mewin jopenji ni, “Raŋo Rwoth Were mawan otimo gigipiny me je riwan?” Wibino dwoko jo ni, “Paka witieko jwangan to witiyo ri werin makicar i piny mewin, ameno wilatic ri jopath i piny ma k'obedo mewin.”",
